{% extends "base.html.j2" %}
{% set r = h.rev %}
{% set mk = r.main_label | t %}
{% set web = r.offsets[0] %}
{% set pub = h.public %}
{% set u = h.unsure %}
{% set w = h.world %}
{% set ln = h.learning %}
{% set verdict_word = {"unusual_low": {"zh": "比平时低得多", "en": "Far below normal"},
                       "unusual_high": {"zh": "比平时高得多", "en": "Far above normal"},
                       "within_usual_range": {"zh": "在正常波动内", "en": "Within the usual range"}} %}
{% block title %}{{ "analyst-in-a-box · 这个数为什么变了，接下来该谁去做什么" if zh else "analyst-in-a-box · Why did this number move, and who should act next" }}{% endblock %}
{% block description %}{% if zh %}一个开源的经营分析 skill，装进你的 AI 工具用：先判断变化算不算异常，再找出变在哪、为什么，最后指到负责人。每个数字都由本机脚本算出。{% else %}An open-source business-analysis skill for your AI tool: it first decides whether a change is unusual, then finds where and why it moved and who should act. Every number is computed by local scripts.{% endif %}{% endblock %}
{% block body_class %}home{% endblock %}
{% block content %}
<section class="hero"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="hero-copy">
    {% if zh %}
    <h1><span class="ph">把你手上的几张表，</span><br><span class="ph">变成一套会答题的分析能力。</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">订单、商品、流量、活动几张表放进同一个文件夹，答几道选择题，就长出指标树、业务世界描述和第一份报告。</p>
    <p class="roles">脚本算每一个数、跑每一项检查；AI 读懂问题、写解释、从文档里提出原因；你只判断它对业务的理解对不对，纠正几处。分析一键跑完。</p>
    {% else %}
    <h1>Turn the tables you already have into something that can answer questions about them.</h1>
    <p class="lede">Put your orders, products, traffic and campaign tables in one folder and answer a few multiple-choice questions. It grows a metric tree, a business world description and a first report.</p>
    <p class="roles">Scripts compute every number and run every check. The AI understands the question, writes the explanation and proposes causes from documents. You only judge whether its understanding of your business is right, and correct a few spots. The analysis runs in one go.</p>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
  <div class="hero-try">
    <div class="install" id="install"><code><span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">npx skills add weigezi/analyst-in-a-box</span></code>
      <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="install">{{ "复制" if zh else "Copy" }}</button></div>
    <p class="install-note">{% if zh %}或<a href="downloads/{{ skill_package.name }}">下载 skill 包</a>（{{ skill_package.kb }} KB，版本 {{ skill_package.version }}），放进你的 AI 工具的 skill 目录。{% else %}Or <a href="downloads/{{ skill_package.name }}">download the package</a> ({{ skill_package.kb }} KB, version {{ skill_package.version }}) and put it in your AI tool's skills folder.{% endif %}</p>
    <div class="ctas">
      <a class="btn" href="intake.html">{{ "看它怎么形成" if zh else "See how it forms" }}</a>
      <a class="btn ghost" href="#evidence">{{ "先看证据" if zh else "See the evidence" }}</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="trust"><li>Apache-2.0</li><li>{{ "数据在本机算" if zh else "Data is processed locally" }}</li><li>{{ "CSV、Excel、SQLite、DuckDB" if zh else "CSV, Excel, SQLite, DuckDB" }}</li></ul>
  </div>

  <div class="session" aria-label="{{ '在 AI 工具里的一次会话' if zh else 'One session in an AI tool' }}">
    <div class="sess-bar"><span>{{ "AI 工具里的一次会话，演示店数据" if zh else "A session in an AI tool, on the demo shop data" }}</span>
      <button class="replay" type="button" id="replay">{{ "重放" if zh else "Replay" }}</button></div>
    <div class="msg-user reveal">{{ r.question | t }}</div>
    <ol class="progress reveal">
      {% set qc = r.quality.checks %}
      <li><b>{{ "检查数据" if zh else "Check the data" }}</b><span>{% if zh %}{{ qc | length }} 项都通过{% else %}all {{ qc | length }} checks pass{% endif %}</span></li>
      <li><b>{{ "和过去比" if zh else "Compare with the past" }}</b><span>{% if zh %}离常态是平时波动的 {{ r.q.robust_z | times }} 倍，算异常{% else %}{{ r.q.robust_z | times }}× the usual wobble: unusual{% endif %}</span></li>
      <li><b>{{ "按" ~ (r.main_dim | t) ~ "拆" if zh else "Break down by " ~ (r.main_dim | t | lower) }}</b><span>{% if zh %}{{ mk }}少了 {{ -r.main.value | wan }}，{{ web.label | t }}多了 {{ web.value | wan }}{% else %}{{ mk }} lost {{ -r.main.value | wan }}, {{ web.label | t | lower }} gained {{ web.value | wan }}{% endif %}</span></li>
      {% set ev = r.cause.citations[0] %}
      <li><b>{{ "找原因" if zh else "Find the reason" }}</b><span>{% if zh %}{{ ev.start | md }}起{{ ev.text | t | replace("。", "") }}{% else %}from {{ ev.start | md }}: {{ ev.text | t }}{% endif %}</span></li>
    </ol>
    <article class="answer reveal" aria-label="{{ '样例结论' if zh else 'Sample conclusion' }}">
      <p class="answer-cap"><b>{{ data.meta.shop | t }}</b>{{ "，" if zh else ", " }}<span class="tnum">{{ r.current | daterange }}</span>{{ "，对比去年同周" if zh else ", against the same week last year" }}</p>
      <h2>{% if zh %}<span class="ph">营收同比 {{ r.total.growth | pct }}：</span><br><span class="ph">{{ mk }}少了 {{ -r.main.value | wan }}，</span><span class="ph">{{ web.label | t }}多了 {{ web.value | wan }}</span>{% else %}<span class="ph">Revenue {{ r.total.growth | pct }} on last year:</span><br><span class="ph">{{ mk }} lost {{ -r.main.value | wan }},</span> <span class="ph">{{ web.label | t | lower }} gained {{ web.value | wan }}</span>{% endif %}</h2>
      <div class="figure-row">
        <div><div class="big {{ r.total.growth | tone }}">{{ r.total.growth | pct }}</div>
          <div class="big-sub tnum">{{ r.total.base | money }} → {{ r.total.cur | money }}</div></div>
        <div class="spark-wrap">
          <p class="spark-chip"><span class="chip">{{ verdict_word[r.verdict] | t }}</span></p>
          <div data-chart="revenue_last_week.spark" data-label="{{ '过去每周的同比变化和本周' if zh else 'Past weekly year-on-year changes and this week' }}"></div>
          <div class="spark-cap"><span>{% if zh %}过去 {{ r.history_n }} 周的同比和本周{% else %}Last {{ r.history_n }} weeks, and this one{% endif %}</span></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="ans-cause"><span class="tag">{{ "原因有记录" if zh else "Cause on record" }}</span>{% if zh %}{{ ev.start | md }}起，{{ ev.text | t }}{% else %}From {{ ev.start | md }}: {{ ev.text | t }}{% endif %}
        <a href="reports/revenue_last_week.html">{{ "看完整报告" if zh else "Read the full report" }}</a></p>
    </article>
  </div>
</div></section>
<section class="sec msg" id="m-explain"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="msg-text">
    <h2>{{ "像分析师一样回答「为什么」" if zh else "Answers “why” like an analyst" }}</h2>
    <p>{% if zh %}先判断算不算异常，再按公式和渠道两个方向拆开。每一块都由脚本算出，加起来正好等于总变化。拆出来的是结果，有出处的记录才算原因，并指到负责人。{% else %}It first decides whether the change is unusual, then breaks it down by formula and by channel. Scripts compute every part, and the parts add up exactly to the total change. What the breakdown finds is a result; only a record with a source counts as a cause, and it names the owner.{% endif %}</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="reports/revenue_last_week.html">{{ "看完整报告" if zh else "Read the full report" }}</a></p>
  </div>
  <figure class="r-fig msg-fig"><figcaption class="r-figtitle">{{ "营收变化按渠道拆开（单位：元）" if zh else "Revenue change by channel (¥)" }}</figcaption>
    <div data-chart="revenue_last_week.waterfall" data-total="{{ '合计变化' if zh else 'Total change' }}" data-others="{{ '其余 {n} 组' if zh else 'Other {n} groups' }}" data-label="{{ '营收变化按渠道拆开' if zh else 'Revenue change by channel' }}"></div></figure>
</div></section>

<section class="sec msg" id="m-graph"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="msg-text">
    <h2>{{ "乱表自己理成业务知识图谱" if zh else "Tangled tables become a business knowledge graph" }}</h2>
    <p>{% if zh %}{{ h.intake.tables }} 张表放进去，它认出主表和表之间怎么对上，答几道选择题确认每列是什么，就长出指标树和业务世界描述：渠道、品类、发生过的事、背后的机制、该谁负责。{% else %}Put in {{ h.intake.tables }} tables. It finds the main one and how they join, you answer a few multiple-choice questions about the columns, and it grows a metric tree and a business world description: channels, categories, what happened, the mechanisms behind it, and who is responsible.{% endif %}</p>
    <p class="msg-links"><a class="btn" href="intake.html">{{ "看它怎么形成" if zh else "See how it forms" }}</a><a class="btn ghost" href="graph.html">{{ "看业务知识图谱" if zh else "Open the graph" }}</a></p>
  </div>
  <ul class="facts">
    <li><b class="tnum">{{ w.metrics }}</b>{{ "个指标" if zh else "metrics" }}</li>
    <li><b class="tnum">{{ w.entities }}</b>{{ "样东西" if zh else "things" }}</li>
    <li><b class="tnum">{{ w.mechanisms }}</b>{{ "条机制" if zh else "mechanisms" }}</li>
    <li><b class="tnum">{{ w.events }}</b>{{ "个事件" if zh else "events" }}</li>
  </ul>
</div></section>

<section class="sec msg" id="m-learn"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="msg-text">
    <h2>{{ "越用越懂你的业务" if zh else "Learns your business as you use it" }}</h2>
    <p>{% if zh %}你纠正一次，它把这句话记成带出处的事件，下次这道题会引用它。{% if ln.caught %}把这条记录删掉，回归题立刻报错。{% endif %}{% else %}Correct it once and it records your sentence as an event with a source; the next run of that question cites it.{% if ln.caught %} Delete the record and a regression case fails at once.{% endif %}{% endif %}</p>
    <p><a class="btn" href="learning.html">{{ "看它怎么学" if zh else "See how it learns" }}</a></p>
  </div>
  <div class="facts one"><p class="e-num tnum">{{ ln.before.explained }}/{{ ln.before.slots }} → {{ ln.after.explained }}/{{ ln.after.slots }}</p>
    <p>{{ "客单价那道题，纠正前后有原因可引的位置" if zh else "On the order-value question, places that can cite a cause, before and after one correction" }}</p></div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec" id="evidence"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-h"><h2>{{ "每个数都能核对。" if zh else "Every number can be checked." }}</h2></div>
  <div class="entries caps">
    <a class="entry" href="architecture.html"><p class="e-tag">{{ "交付前自检" if zh else "Self-checks" }}</p>
      <p class="e-num tnum">{{ h.n_checks }}</p>
      <p>{{ "每份报告交出去之前过这些检查，有一项不过就不交。" if zh else "Every report passes these checks before it goes out; if one fails, it does not." }}</p></a>
    <div class="entry static"><p class="e-tag">{{ "数据有问题先说" if zh else "Speaks up about broken data" }}</p>
      <p class="e-num tnum">{{ u.dup.duplicates | num }} / {{ u.dup.rows | num }}</p>
      <p>{% if zh %}缺了 {{ u.missing.days | length }} 天，或 {{ u.dup.rows | num }} 行订单里有 {{ u.dup.duplicates | num }} 行重复，它先报出问题，不出结论。{% else %}With {{ u.missing.days | length }} days missing, or {{ u.dup.duplicates | num }} of {{ u.dup.rows | num }} order rows repeated, it reports the problem first and draws no conclusion.{% endif %}</p></div>
    <a class="entry" href="reports/public.html"><p class="e-tag">{{ "真实数据" if zh else "Real data" }}</p>
      <p class="e-num tnum">{{ pub.change | pct }}</p>
      <p>{% if zh %}{{ pub.invoices | num }} 张真实发票，最后一整周在正常波动内，它就说正常，不硬找原因。{% else %}{{ pub.invoices | num }} real invoices. The last full week is within the usual range, and it says so instead of inventing a cause.{% endif %}</p></a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="sec end" id="install-end"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="sec-h"><h2>{{ "装上，然后直接问。" if zh else "Install it, then just ask." }}</h2></div>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li><b>{{ "一行命令装好" if zh else "Install with one line" }}</b>
      <div class="install" id="install2"><code><span class="p">$ </span><span class="k">npx skills add weigezi/analyst-in-a-box</span></code>
        <button class="copy" type="button" data-copy="install2">{{ "复制" if zh else "Copy" }}</button></div></li>
    <li><b>{{ "给它一张表，问一句" if zh else "Give it a table and ask" }}</b><p>{{ "「这是上半年的订单，上周营收为什么跌了？」" if zh else "“Here are this year's orders. Why did revenue fall last week?”" }}</p></li>
  </ol>
</div></section>
{% endblock %}
{% block scripts %}
<script src="{{ root }}assets/site-data.js"></script>
<script src="{{ root }}assets/fmt.js"></script>
<script src="{{ root }}assets/charts.js"></script>
<script src="{{ root }}assets/home.js"></script>
{% endblock %}
